that we wouldn't know exist,

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:50.136
but important no, I mean,

00:09:50.136 --> 00:09:51.116
come on.

00:09:51.116 --> 00:09:54.960
I don't think we're
learning valuable lessons

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.790
