00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:04.740
reality TV is so broad.

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:05.970
There are actually a lot

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:07.080
of very informational,

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:09.450
very fascinating shows.

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:10.920
- [Kyland] I think that
we can see ourselves

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:13.470
in characters all the time,

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:15.150
but I feel for so many

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:16.950
it's probably easier when you're looking

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:18.152
