00:10:18.152 --> 00:10:19.204
real people.

00:10:19.204 --> 00:10:21.390
Oh, if I was in that situation,

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:22.223
how would I respond?

00:10:22.223 --> 00:10:26.340
I feel like there is something
